  "prefLabel": "Sw 503.04 Commission Obligations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 503.04 Commission Obligations. Commencing on the thirtieth day after full compliance with Sw 503.01 through Sw 503.03, or after final determination of any motion filed to vacate or modify a final order, the commission shall make prize payments, subject to tax withholding, in accordance with such order.\n\nSource. #7094, eff 9-15-99; ss by #8898, eff 9-15-07; ss by #10987, eff 12-3-15",
